    {
      "id": "XtUko8jHLR2hxj_QuGKXC",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 5965.555826021984,
      "y": -529.7092406863258,
      "width": 2491.387685940912,
      "height": 258.5716247558594,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ebfbee",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b9i",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1748531727,
      "version": 213,
      "versionNonce": 1330665522,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [
        {
          "id": "7osuwm_y72il1va-6yPqG",
          "type": "arrow"
        },
        {
          "id": "A9LnfZ3zk8wYGFgArZMdG",
          "type": "arrow"
        }
      ],
      "updated": 1776877509060,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "\n\nA Capability Host is an Azure ARM resource that tells Foundry Agent Service where to store your agent's data and optionally which network to run\nin. It exists at two scopes — Account and Project — and together they define the full runtime environment for your agents.\n\n Without it → Microsoft stores everything (Basic Agent) With it → Your resources, your network, your control (Standard Agent",
      "fontSize": 34.47621663411459,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "\n\nA Capability Host is an Azure ARM resource that tells Foundry Agent Service where to store your agent's data and optionally which network to run\nin. It exists at two scopes — Account and Project — and together they define the full runtime environment for your agents.\n\n Without it → Microsoft stores everything (Basic Agent) With it → Your resources, your network, your control (Standard Agent",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "PxXYCLw4nN1ug2z7GxNh7",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 5703.278902601714,
      "y": -3.780880700974194,
      "width": 1498.6114141514386,
      "height": 537.8572082519531,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ebfbee",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b9u",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 176205217,
      "version": 50,
      "versionNonce": 1685335410,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1776877509060,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "\n\nMicrosoft.CognitiveServices/accounts/{name}/capabilityHosts/{name}\n\n {\n   \"properties\": {\n     \"capabilityHostKind\": \"Agents\",              ← required, enables Agent Service\n     \"customerSubnet\":              \"...\",         ← optional, VNet injection\n     \"threadStorageConnections\":   [\"conn-name\"],  ← optional, shared default for all projects\n     \"vectorStoreConnections\":     [\"conn-name\"],  ← optional, shared default for all projects\n     \"storageConnections\":         [\"conn-name\"]   ← optional, shared default for all projects\n   }\n }",
      "fontSize": 33.098905123197135,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "\n\nMicrosoft.CognitiveServices/accounts/{name}/capabilityHosts/{name}\n\n {\n   \"properties\": {\n     \"capabilityHostKind\": \"Agents\",              ← required, enables Agent Service\n     \"customerSubnet\":              \"...\",         ← optional, VNet injection\n     \"threadStorageConnections\":   [\"conn-name\"],  ← optional, shared default for all projects\n     \"vectorStoreConnections\":     [\"conn-name\"],  ← optional, shared default for all projects\n     \"storageConnections\":         [\"conn-name\"]   ← optional, shared default for all projects\n   }\n }",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "vHJbLqour60fMaeIFojG-",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 7344.307464599614,
      "y": -9.852047693161694,
      "width": 1628.909423828125,
      "height": 471.4285914103188,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ebfbee",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
