      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1776882865016,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": " Are you building for production with compliance,data sovereignty, or private networking?\n │\n ├── NO ──► BASIC AGENT\n │          No capability host\n │          MS manages everything\n │\n └── YES\n      │\n      │\n      └────► STANDARD AGENT\n                 Account + Project Capability Hosts\n                 │\n                 ├── Manage your own VNet?\n                 │    ├── YES ──► BYO VNet\n                 │    └── NO  ──► Managed VNet (Preview)\n                 │\n                 └── Your Cosmos · Storage · AI Search\n",
      "fontSize": 35.954449492724336,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": " Are you building for production with compliance,data sovereignty, or private networking?\n │\n ├── NO ──► BASIC AGENT\n │          No capability host\n │          MS manages everything\n │\n └── YES\n      │\n      │\n      └────► STANDARD AGENT\n                 Account + Project Capability Hosts\n                 │\n                 ├── Manage your own VNet?\n                 │    ├── YES ──► BYO VNet\n                 │    └── NO  ──► Managed VNet (Preview)\n                 │\n                 └── Your Cosmos · Storage · AI Search\n",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "Hcp2VMiwJ8X_AdHZCaJsx",
